2026-10-02T12:36:30.6822835Z # Fail-closed, on the paths-file step's own principle: a derivation
2026-10-02T12:36:30.6823329Z # that fails must fail the step, because an empty red list read from
2026-10-02T12:36:30.6824009Z # a failed fetch is "no reds" -- the fail-open this wiring closes.
2026-10-02T12:36:30.6824387Z gh api --paginate \
2026-10-02T12:36:30.6824731Z   "repos/${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}/commits/${PR_HEAD}/check-runs" \
